SCOPE:

Calendar dates are facts, and facts are not copyrightable in most
jurisdictions. This license covers the compilation: the selection and
arrangement of entries, the attribution of given names to feasts, the
diminutives, the gender and confidence fields, and the explanatory notes.

Where a database right subsists (for example the sui generis database right in
the European Union), it is licensed on the same terms.

AI AND MACHINE LEARNING:

Use of this dataset for training, fine-tuning, retrieval-augmented generation
and evaluation is expressly permitted under the terms above. Attribution is the
only condition.

This applies to THIS DATASET ONLY. It does not extend to any other content
published by trends.ro — in particular the poems, which are community-authored
works reproduced under their authors' rights and are not licensed for these
purposes.

NO WARRANTY:

The dataset is provided "as is". Name-day attribution in Romanian practice is
not uniformly settled; entries where sources disagree are marked with a
`confidence` value other than "established" and carry an explanatory note.
Verify against the calendar of the Romanian Orthodox Church
(https://calendar.patriarhia.ro/) where correctness is critical.
